{"4835830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Taillights", "steam_appid": 4835830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5168540], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/a30b0dcdabb44fc4261a780d5c270696.avif?t=1788280262\" width=481 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Four little rascals. One flimsy car. Physics. </i></strong><br><strong><i>Things rarely go according to plan, and that's exactly the point.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taillights</strong> is a physics-based co-op survival road trip where the journey is the destination. Build your vehicle, gather supplies, and keep driving 'till the wheels fall off. Travel alone or with friends, repair your car on the fly, and compete on a fresh community-wide map every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to survive the road. Carry supplies, fix breakdowns, and recover from disasters. Embark on a road trip solo or with up to 4 players online. Build, survive, compete, and create unforgettable stories together on the open road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/518c7fc681ad34b974811ceb7202f697.poster.avif?t=1788280262\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/518c7fc681ad34b974811ceb7202f697.webm?t=1788280262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/518c7fc681ad34b974811ceb7202f697.mp4?t=1788280262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/2e6ef36a17c3a20f7e4220121ac93754.avif?t=1788280262\" width=481 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep you paw on the gas. Read a map badly. Get lost in the backroads. Chase your teammates around with a baseball bat. It's all fun and games but don't take too long - cryptids, conspiracies, and all sorts of calamities come to life after sun-down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/49ddc7b28d245c3ad0ffca08eb363608.poster.avif?t=1788280262\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/49ddc7b28d245c3ad0ffca08eb363608.webm?t=1788280262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/49ddc7b28d245c3ad0ffca08eb363608.mp4?t=1788280262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/821d6e5b8992706f616ae8c5e085b83b.avif?t=1788280262\" width=524 height=88 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and attach parts with unique gameplay implications to your vehicle, or just do it for the style points. Bullhorns on the hood? Check! Flame decals on the doors? Check! Giant spoiler on the roof that is scientifically proven to make you go faster? Check! You can do it all - while  speeding down highways, tumbling down hillsides, or floating down rivers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/860f057e55bbe4db522a631c16546b04.poster.avif?t=1788280262\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/860f057e55bbe4db522a631c16546b04.webm?t=1788280262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/860f057e55bbe4db522a631c16546b04.mp4?t=1788280262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/18ea65207fca1674ebc21765d8307959.avif?t=1788280262\" width=481 height=87 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game refreshes its map (and leaderboard) daily, serving up a new challenge for the entire community every 24hours. Everybody plays the same map on the same day, and fights for the same top spot on the calendar. Will you come together to share knowledge of item locations, shortcuts, and supplies - or will you keep it all to yourself to give your team the upper hand?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/44a16f16620d6cdb2633cdd0390a90fa.poster.avif?t=1788280262\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/44a16f16620d6cdb2633cdd0390a90fa.webm?t=1788280262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/44a16f16620d6cdb2633cdd0390a90fa.mp4?t=1788280262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature list</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛻 Cooperate, bicker, and slapfight on the road - just like an IRL roadtrip!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔨  Break more stuff than you fix. Replace broken things with cooler things. Look snazzy doing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧃 Loot everything that isn't nailed down, and then wonder who nailed everything down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤪 Experience unhinged physics that have nothing to do with what you learned in physics class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ Become a driving hazard solo, or with 3 other rascals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 Balance hunger, thirst, and poor impulse control on a minute to minute basis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧟 Encounter various types of enemies. Add &quot;run over&quot; to your fight or flight reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 Embrace disaster; it's all baked into the experience anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/a30b0dcdabb44fc4261a780d5c270696.avif?t=1788280262\" width=481 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Four little rascals. One flimsy car. Physics. </i></strong><br><strong><i>Things rarely go according to plan, and that's exactly the point.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taillights</strong> is a physics-based co-op survival road trip where the journey is the destination. Build your vehicle, gather supplies, and keep driving 'till the wheels fall off. Travel alone or with friends, repair your car on the fly, and compete on a fresh community-wide map every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to survive the road. Carry supplies, fix breakdowns, and recover from disasters. Embark on a road trip solo or with up to 4 players online. Build, survive, compete, and create unforgettable stories together on the open road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla