5830/extras/821d6e5b8992706f616ae8c5e085b83b.avif?t=1788280262\" width=524 height=88 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and attach parts with unique gameplay implications to your vehicle, or just do it for the style points. Bullhorns on the hood? Check! Flame decals on the doors? Check! Giant spoiler on the roof that is scientifically proven to make you go faster? Check! You can do it all - while  speeding down highways, tumbling down hillsides, or floating down rivers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/860f057e55bbe4db522a631c16546b04.poster.avif?t=1788280262\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/860f057e55bbe4db522a631c16546b04.webm?t=1788280262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/860f057e55bbe4db522a631c16546b04.mp4?t=1788280262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835830/extras/18ea65207fca1674ebc21765d8307959.avif?t=1788280262\" width=481 height=87 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game refreshes its map (and leaderboard) daily, serving up a new challenge for the entire community every 24hours. Everybody plays the same map on the same day, and fights for the same top spot on the calendar. Will you come together to share knowledge of item locations, shortcuts, and supplies - or will you keep it all to yourself to give your team the upper hand?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst